20:02.790 --> 20:03.940
.Uh, yes-
.呃，是的-

20:03.940 --> 20:05.550
.Yes, I do, lad
是的，我愿意，小伙子

20:05.550 --> 20:08.380
Well, the Krusty Krab is
.only a short walk away
嗯，蟹堡王是
.仅几步之遥

20:08.380 --> 20:11.390
Why don't you head on
?down for old time's sake
你为什么不继续前进
？为了旧时光而放下

20:11.390 --> 20:13.480
.Oh, I can't leave, Mr. Krabs-
.哦，我不能离开，蟹老板-

20:13.480 --> 20:14.380
?What about the stand
?展位怎么样

20:14.380 --> 20:15.890
.Oh, don't worry, lad-
.哦，别担心，小伙子-

20:15.890 --> 20:17.530
.I'll watch the stand for you
.我会为你看守看台

20:17.530 --> 20:19.090
?You will-
？你会-

20:19.090 --> 20:19.790
.No-
。不-

20:19.790 --> 20:22.110
.I've got a better idea
.我有一个更好的主意

20:22.110 --> 20:26.870
I'll take this old roadside
.stand off your hands for keeps
我会走这条旧路边
.保持双手远离

20:26.870 --> 20:30.610
And in exchange, I'll
,give you the Krusty Krab
作为交换，我会
给你蟹堡王

20:30.610 --> 20:35.620
,with Squidward, the grill
.and all those squeaky pickles
，和章鱼哥一起，烧烤
.还有那些吱吱作响的泡菜

20:35.620 --> 20:39.120
?What did you say, Mr. Krabs-
？你说什么，蟹老板-

20:39.120 --> 20:40.100
Here's the key-
这是关键——

20:40.100 --> 20:41.670
.the Krusty Krab
.蟹堡王

20:41.670 --> 20:44.490
.She's yours now
.她现在是你的了

20:44.490 --> 20:45.420
.Thank you-
。谢谢-

20:48.190 --> 20:50.550
?What should I do now, Mr. Krabs
？我现在该怎么办，蟹老板

20:50.550 --> 20:51.250
.Run to her, boy-
.跑向她，男孩-

20:51.250 --> 20:54.810
.She's waiting for you
.她在等你

20:54.810 --> 20:57.550
I can't feel my-
.legs, Mr. Krabs
我感觉不到我的——
.legs，蟹老板

20:57.550 --> 20:58.480
.Don't worry, lad-
.别担心，小伙子-

20:58.480 --> 20:59.520
.I'll fix it
.我会解决它

20:59.520 --> 21:02.740
Get this to the Krusty
.Krab on the double
把这个交给 Krusty
.双蟹蟹

21:02.740 --> 21:05.160
!Good luck, lad
！祝你好运，小伙子

21:05.160 --> 21:09.520
.Dreams do come true-
.梦想成真-

21:09.520 --> 21:11.260
[GASP]
[喘气]

21:24.450 --> 21:27.330
,Ladies and gentlemen-
Pretty Patties
,女士们先生们-
漂亮的肉饼

21:27.330 --> 21:29.530
.is now under new management
.现在处于新的管理之下

21:29.530 --> 21:31.490
?Who's next
?下一个是谁

21:31.490 --> 21:33.930
[CHEERING]
[欢呼]

21:40.290 --> 21:45.410
,I'm ready, I'm ready
.I'm ready for my money
，我准备好了，我准备好了
.我已经准备好拿我的钱了

21:45.410 --> 21:47.680
.Welcome to Pretty Patties
.欢迎来到漂亮馅饼

21:47.680 --> 21:49.200
?May I take your money
？我可以拿你的钱吗

21:49.200 --> 21:51.370
.We want a refund, Krabs-
.我们想要退款，蟹蟹-

21:51.370 --> 21:53.050
[AGREEMENT]
[协议]

21:53.740 --> 21:55.170
?What-
？什么-

21:55.170 --> 21:58.870
Your dumb pretty patties-
.turned my face purple
你那愚蠢的漂亮肉饼——
.把我的脸变成紫色

21:58.870 --> 22:02.070
.Look what I got under my cape-
.看看我斗篷下有什么-

22:02.070 --> 22:05.880
!And look at our tongues-
！看看我们的舌头——

22:05.880 --> 22:08.880
?What's wrong with you-
？你这人怎么回事-

22:08.880 --> 22:15.490
We want our money-
.back, all 46,853 of us
我们想要我们的钱——
.back，我们 46,853 人

22:15.490 --> 22:16.390
?Hey, where'd he go
？嘿，他去哪儿了

22:24.540 --> 22:25.240
!My key-
!我的钥匙-

22:25.240 --> 22:26.720
?Where's my key
？我的钥匙在哪里

22:26.720 --> 22:27.420
!Spongebob
！海绵宝宝

22:27.420 --> 22:29.160
!Spongebob, let me in
！海绵宝宝，让我进去

22:29.160 --> 22:31.130
!Spongebob
！海绵宝宝

22:31.130 --> 22:34.560
[SQUEAKING]
[吱吱声]

22:43.920 --> 22:48.570
[MUSIC PLAYING]
[音乐播放]

[音乐播放]